  "problem": "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5x-8 \\\\  & x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,5{x}^{2}+\\phantom{0}7x+\\phantom{0}8\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5{x}^{2}+15x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-8x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{8x-24}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,32\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, we conclude the following:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"1\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"25\" height=\"25\" align=\"center\">$5{x}^{2}+7x+8$</td>\n\n<td width=\"20\" align=\"center\">$=$</td>\n\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\" align=\"center\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"30\" align=\"center\">$+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"50\" height=\"25\" align=\"center\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td width=\"25\" align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"25\" height=\"25\" align=\"center\">$x+3$</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"25\" height=\"25\" align=\"center\">$x+3$</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
